00:27:45.980 --> 00:27:51.480
To your second question, Jen,
about the candidate experience,

00:27:51.480 --> 00:27:54.030
it may actually come as a
shock to those in the room,

00:27:54.030 --> 00:27:58.280
but most people find searching
for a job somewhat frustrating.

00:27:58.280 --> 00:28:01.040
And it can be a very
difficult process,

00:28:01.040 --> 00:28:05.340
and they don't have recruiters
hounding them and stalking them

00:28:05.340 --> 00:28:08.310
online, like I'm
