00:28:08.310 --> 00:28:11.250
For most members who are
looking for a new job,

00:28:11.250 --> 00:28:14.550
the onus is really on them
to look for a new company,

00:28:14.550 --> 00:28:18.450
to find a match both from a
culture perspective, a location

00:28:18.450 --> 00:28:22.290
perspective, and a
brand perspective,

00:28:22.290 --> 00:28:25.000
and to find that right
opportunity at the right time.

00:28:25.000 --> 00:28:28.172
And so they take a lot
of time researching.

00:28:28.172 --> 00:28:29.880
And there are a number
of different sites

00:28:29.880 --> 00:28:33.360
that they visit to do that,
including a company career

00:28:33.360 --> 00:28:33.910
site.

00:28:33.910 --> 00:28:36.330
And so as they go
through their research

00:28:36.330 --> 00:28:40.800
phase and their
process, that experience

00:28:40.800 --> 00:28:42.780
can somewhat feel
a little clunky

00:28:42.780 --> 00:28:47.550
to them, especially at the point
